# Pinned differential cases — known, DOCUMENTED divergences from the oracle.
#
#   CASE_ID   CORPUS   SECTION   reason
#
# CASE_ID and CORPUS are shell GLOBS, so `callees-*` pins a whole command
# family and a bare `*` still means everything.  SECTION names the entry in
# dev/DIVERGENCES.md that explains the case; a pin with no such entry is not a
# pin, it is an unexplained failure with the alarm switched off.
#
# A glob must not over-reach: a pinned case that AGREES is a stale pin, so
# `unused-*` may pin the family only because EVERY member of it differs here.
#
# A pinned case that AGREES is reported as a STALE PIN and fails the run: a pin
# that no longer describes anything is a lie about the state of the port.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# D7 — the oracle's line index crashes on a multi-name `axiomatization`
#
# `graph._build_line_index` sorts `(src_start, thy_end, Entry)` tuples.  Two
# AXIOM entries declared by one `axiomatization` line share both integers, so
# Python falls through to comparing two `Entry` dataclasses and raises
# TypeError.  Every command that builds the line index — `grep`, `sorry`, and
# in P3 the whole call graph — dies with a traceback and exit 1 on any corpus
# that has such a line.  FOL and ZF both do.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

grep-name              FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-count             FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-names             FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-with-comments     FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-noop-n            FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-alternation       FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-anchored          FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-no-match          FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-dir               FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-cartouche         FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
dashdash               FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
grep-names-comments    FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
sorry-default          FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
sorry-count            FOL   D7   oracle TypeError in _build_line_index
